     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet fiji-condition-code-vs</b></p><a name=\"fiji-condition-code-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcfiji-condition-code-vs\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where expression  = &lt; 404684003 |Clinical finding| AND ^ 10811000132104 |International Patient Summary reference set|</li><li>Include codes from<a href=\"http://www.snomed.org/\"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span> where expression  = &lt; 243796009 |Situation with explicit context| AND ^ 10811000132104 |International Patient Summary reference set|</li></ul></div>"
